      "Bronze diabetes refers to the combination of skin pigmentation and diabetes mellitus in hemochromatosis.",
      "Phlebotomy is the mainstay of treatment to reduce iron overload.",
      "Untreated hemochromatosis can lead to hepatocellular carcinoma."
