      "PV can lead to increased blood viscosity and risk of thrombosis.",
      "Common symptoms include headache, dizziness, pruritus (especially after a hot shower), and erythromelalgia.",
      "Splenomegaly is a common finding due to extramedullary hematopoiesis.",
      "Erythropoietin levels are typically low in PV due to negative feedback.",
      "Bone marrow biopsy shows hypercellularity with increased erythroid, granulocytic, and megakaryocytic proliferation."
