      "BPA mimics estrogen and can bind to estrogen receptors, potentially leading to reproductive issues and increased cancer risk.",
      "Phthalates are used as plasticizers and can disrupt testosterone synthesis, affecting male reproductive development.",
      "PCBs are industrial chemicals that can interfere with thyroid hormone function, leading to developmental and neurological issues.",
      "The fetal and neonatal periods are particularly vulnerable to endocrine disruptor exposure due to critical developmental processes.",
      "Regulatory bodies like the FDA and EPA provide guidelines to limit exposure to known endocrine disruptors."
