      "Secretin, produced by S cells in the duodenum, stimulates bicarbonate secretion from the pancreas and inhibits gastric acid secretion.",
      "Motilin, secreted by M cells in the small intestine, regulates the migrating motor complex (MMC).",
      "Glucose-dependent insulinotropic peptide (GIP) is released by K cells in the duodenum and jejunum and stimulates insulin secretion."
