      "Complications include pseudocyst formation, necrosis, and systemic inflammatory response syndrome (SIRS).",
      "CT scan is the imaging modality of choice to assess pancreatic inflammation and complications.",
      "Initial management includes aggressive IV fluid resuscitation, pain control, and nutritional support."
