      "Prader-Willi syndrome is characterized by hypotonia, obesity, and intellectual disability.",
      "Angelman syndrome is characterized by severe intellectual disability, seizures, and a happy demeanor.",
      "Uniparental disomy can lead to imprinting disorders when both chromosomes are inherited from one parent.",
      "Methylation-specific PCR is used to diagnose imprinting disorders by identifying abnormal methylation patterns."
