      "Guillain-Barré syndrome is an acute inflammatory demyelinating polyneuropathy often preceded by infection.",
      "Alcoholic neuropathy results from chronic alcohol abuse and nutritional deficiencies, particularly thiamine.",
      "Stocking-glove pattern of sensory loss is characteristic of distal symmetrical polyneuropathy.",
      "Small fiber neuropathy primarily affects pain and temperature sensation, often with autonomic involvement."
