      "Influenza virus is a common cause of viral pneumonia, especially in the elderly and immunocompromised.",
      "Legionella pneumophila is associated with contaminated water sources and causes severe pneumonia.",
      "Haemophilus influenzae type b (Hib) can cause epiglottitis, especially in unvaccinated children.",
      "Respiratory syncytial virus (RSV) is a leading cause of bronchiolitis in infants.",
      "Klebsiella pneumoniae is associated with alcoholics and produces thick, mucoid sputum."
