      "Nephrotic syndrome increases the risk of thromboembolism due to loss of antithrombin III.",
      "Hyperlipidemia in nephrotic syndrome is due to increased hepatic lipoprotein synthesis.",
      "Edema results from hypoalbuminemia leading to decreased plasma oncotic pressure."
