      "RAS can lead to ischemic nephropathy and progressive renal failure.",
      "The 'string of beads' appearance on angiography is characteristic of fibromuscular dysplasia.",
      "ACE inhibitors can precipitate acute renal failure in bilateral RAS or solitary kidney stenosis.",
      "Renal artery angioplasty with or without stenting is a treatment option for significant stenosis."
