      "EB simplex is due to mutations in keratin genes (KRT5, KRT14).",
      "Junctional EB involves mutations in laminin and collagen XVII genes.",
      "Dystrophic EB is associated with mutations in the COL7A1 gene.",
      "Management focuses on wound care, infection prevention, and pain control."
