      "Eosinophilia is a common laboratory finding, although it may be absent in hyperinfection syndrome.",
      "Diagnosis is confirmed by detecting larvae in stool samples or through serology in chronic cases.",
      "Ivermectin is the first-line treatment, with albendazole as an alternative.",
