      "Microfilariae are present in peripheral blood during the day, aiding in diagnosis via blood smear.",
      "Diethylcarbamazine (DEC) is the treatment of choice, but caution is needed in high microfilaremia to prevent severe reactions.",
      "Loiasis can complicate treatment of onchocerciasis due to overlapping endemic regions."
